  "description": "WHartTest 是一款AI驱动的测试自动化平台，实现从需求到可执行测试用例的自动化生成与管理，帮助测试团队提升效率与覆盖率。 (WHartTest is an AI-driven test automation platform that automates the generation and management of executable test cases from requirements, helping testing teams improve efficiency and coverage.)",
